  - title: Bag
    categoryLabel: Lesson
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The first word you're going to learn is the word bag.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c503e5d6fc56e3c43b2f955f720fb851, type: 3}
    - message: A bag is something you use to carry your things.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a48cb64605ba84943b036e2cd81ed787, type: 3}
    - message: The word Bag begins with the initial letter B.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 23366832404998d41b6c4071bbadd5b9, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by letter a, g.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5402b39c7df772a4687dece9b6f504ba, type: 3}
    - message: Since B is the initial letter, type it as a capital letter. Remember
        to Capitalize a letter, you have to press dot 6 before the corresponding
        letter.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1cb3911e951d2148a8f5d5b44427c97, type: 3}
    - message: The word bag ends with the rime -ag.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b2727b58d173cb4ebbb459b5038c29f, type: 3}
    practiceWord: bag
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 1
    promptMessage: Can you type the word Bag?
    promptAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66bbae15b9ac4c046be69b35106dfe87, type: 3}
    successMessage: That is Correct!
    successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 806f9040f8926b94db47e2caef85d97b, type: 3}
    wrongMessage: Wrong Answer, Please Try Again.
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd615f4eef83e3b49b22a11445f9b6d6, type: 3}
    supportMessage: 'Remember, the word is Bag. Begin with a capital B, then type
      a, and g. '
    supportAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 44d3b74657ba5c743af855a10c4a2242, type: 3}
